CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-variable a
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
OUTPUT address_of\("volatile-write"
--
--
A write to a volatile variable selected with --nondet-volatile-variable is
preserved as an observable side effect (an OUTPUT of the written value), not
only in the whole-program --nondet-volatile mode. The zero-initialisation of
the global is not observed.
